    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">60 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 4 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Ride Hailing / Cab Booking (Uber, Ola)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Design the cab-booking core that Uber asks in its L4/L5 LLD round and Amazon, Salesforce, Meesho, Zepto and MakeMyTrip ask too: riders request a cab, the system picks a driver with a swappable matching strategy, the trip walks through a strict state machine, fares come from a pluggable fare rule, and forty riders hitting \"Book\" at the same instant never get the same driver. Running Java, Python and C++14 code included.</p>\n"
